      "ref": "[D539]",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A parent reports that the ESRB rating system includes Interactive Elements which highlight online features such as user interaction, location sharing, in-app purchases, and unrestricted internet access.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Interactive Elements highlight interactive or online features that may be of interest or concern but do not influence the rating assignment of a product. This includes users’ ability to interact with each other, the sharing of users’ location with other users, if purchases of digital goods or services are offered, and/or if unrestricted internet access is provided."
    }
